ents/view/11694641","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-11-18","type":"entitlement","what":"第1次中期股息登记日","what_en":"Entitlement date for 1st interim dividend","ann":"11694641","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11694641","src":"ai"},{"date":"2027-01-31","type":"results_due","what":"下一季 (11 月底结束) 季报最迟公布日 · 交易所规定","what_en":"Deadline for the quarter ending Nov (Bursa rule)","src":"rule"}],"recent_en":"Ancom Nylex has been actively buying back shares and declared a first interim dividend via distribution of treasury shares (1 treasury share per 100 shares held). Meanwhile, the company called off the RM77 million sale of a Maxlive stake to Topnext. Latest quarterly revenue rose 16.1% YoY and net profit 35.5% YoY, though both declined QoQ.","notable_en":["The company declared a first interim dividend via distribution of treasury shares, 1 treasury share for every 100 shares held.","The company called off the RM77 million sale of a Maxlive stake to Topnext.","Director Stephan Schnabel acquired 5 million shares from the open market on 30 October."],"risks_en":["The company has been continuously buying back shares, which may affect its share capital structure.","The company terminated the Maxlive stake sale; further asset disposal progress should be monitored."],"earnings_en":"For the quarter ended 31 August 2026, revenue was RM533.4 million, up 16.1% YoY but down 12.4% QoQ; net profit was RM23.13 million, up 35.5% YoY but down 7.6% QoQ; net margin was 4.3% versus 4.1% a year earlier."}